FocusFlow v1.0.0\

First public release of FocusFlow for Android.

Highlights:
• Focus and Pomodoro timer
• Study-session tracking
• Break management
• Daily study-time statistics
• Portrait and landscape support
• Offline operation

Installation:
1. Download FocusFlow-v1.0.0.apk
2. Open the downloaded APK.
3. Allow installation from this source if Android requests permission.
4. Install FocusFlow.

Developer: Akash Kumar
